                <mxCell id="27" value="Partnership" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#6A00FF;strokeColor=#3700CC;fontColor=#ffffff;gradientDirection=south;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-143" y="-770" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="53" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Business rules:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;1. Bookingsystem: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Users can search for available dates, &lt;br&gt;book rooms and pay directly through the platform.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;2. Event calendar:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Users can view upcoming events such as ghost tours or themed events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;3. Package tours: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Users can customize their packages based on interests and availability,&lt;br&gt;including overnight stays, events and attractions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;4. Explore haunted places: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Users can search for haunted places based on location, type or other criteria.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;5. Detailed information for each place:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Detailed information is provided for each haunted place, &lt;br&gt;including it's history, reported hauntings and multimedia content.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;6. User reviews and ratings:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Users can leave reviews and ratings for places, overnight stays and events they have experienced.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;7. Push notifications: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Users recieve push notifications about upcoming events or special offers,&lt;br&gt;users can customize their notification preferences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;8. Community features: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Users can engage in discussions, share tips and ask questions within the community.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;9. Resource library: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Resources such as articles, books, movies and TV-shows related to hauntings are provided.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;10. Premium features: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Premium features are offered for a fee, including access to exclusive content,&lt;br&gt;pre-booking, offline information download and ad-free experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 0%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;11. Partnerships:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Partnerships are formed with travel agencies, event organizers, authors, &lt;br&gt;filmmakers and advertisers interested in hauntings.&lt;br&gt;Targeted advertising is offered based on user interests and behavior.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=#3A5431;fillColor=#6d8764;strokeWidth=1;spacing=5;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-1283" y="-1173" width="492" height="642" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="GbvNqrGWd-LkfozxG_Ix-102" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;sketch=0;hachureGap=4;jiggle=2;curveFitting=1;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#CC6600;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=16;" parent="1" edge="1">
